SSuppression=68; : This is the number of times the unit has retaliated in combat during the turn. :
SMP=69;
SMaxMP=70;
AHealingAura=71;
SPlane=72;  : valid values = 1 or 2. Attempting to set any other value will have no effect.
 ALWAYS set the X and Y coordinates immediately after setting the plane to guarantee the unit is at a valid coordinate.
 Failing to do that will lead to crashes. Always set and read this data on the base unit. 
 Always set the Y coordinate last, as it is the one that refreshes the unit position cache. :
SOLX=73; : Will be converted to valid coordinates, for example X=61 on a map that is 60 tiles wide will set X=1 instead. Always set and read this data on the base unit.  :
SOLY=74; : Attempting to set an Y value below 1 or above the highest valid value for the current plane will do nothing. Always set and read this data on the base unit.  
Note that changing the Y coordinate of units will refresh the unit count and tile ownership cache for all units so repeated usage can make scripts slow.:
SCoX=75; : Valid values are from 1 to 29. Always set and read this data on the base unit.  :
SCoY=76; : Valid values are from 1 to 29. Always set and read this data on the base unit.  :
AFantastic=77;
SCreatePower=78;
ASailing=79;
SOwner=80; 
SCost=81;
STypeID=82; : This is the ID of the unit's main unit type. :
SHeroID=83; : This is the ID of the unit's hero type if the unit is a hero. Changing this value is not recommended. :
ACounterImmunity=84;
AStealth=85;
AHealer=86;
ANoHealing=87;
SFigures=88; : The number of maximal - not current - figures in the unit :
ALargeShield=89;
SBonusHP=90; : Amount of extra HP gained that's not part of the unit's base HP, such as life drain. These are always gold. :
SEoTHeal=92; : Amount of HP to heal in addition at the end of overland turns (-128 to 127) :
SEoTHealPerc=93; : Amount of percentage healing received in addition to the default at end of overland turns. If set to 0, default healing applies. Setting this to -100 will disable healing from all sources except Regeneration and Herb Mastery. :
SSpellAbility=94; : Spell Ability a unit has. Please be aware a unit can only have one spell, so heroes should under normal circumstances, have no spell ability as they might gain one from artifacts. :
SSpellCharges=95; : How many charges are available for the above spell ability. This is the maximal amount, "charges left" is restored to this value between battles :
SChargesLeft=96; : How many charges are remaining to use in the current battle :
